SUMMARY:Two For the Road
DESCRIPTION:Two for the Road features Leesburg locals Jeff Godbold & Ken Logerwell\, with Jeff on rhythm guitar and vocals and Ken on lead guitar. Their music spans a range of genres including Americana\, folk\, yacht rock\, classic rock\, and country. Their influences include Sting\, Eagles\, Doobie Brothers\, Atlanta Rhythm Section\, John Mellencamp\, Allman Brothers\, Hall & Oates\, Bob Seger\, America\, and Willie Nelson. Two for the Road can be found around town playing at open mic nights that encourage audience participation with their music.
